  crumb="Customer journey analytics"
  dek="Customers do not experience departments. They experience one journey that happens to cross marketing, product, operations, billing and support. Journey analytics tries to measure it that way."
  definition="<strong>Customer journey analytics</strong> is the practice of joining the interactions and operational events that make up a customer's path, across channels and systems, and measuring how customers move along it: where they progress, where they stall, where they drop out and how long each step takes."
